VioletCity_Gym_Text_Intro::
    .string "I am FALKNER, the GYM LEADER.\n"
    .string "Bird POKEMON are my partners.\p"
    .string "Even KANTO champions can find\n"
    .string "something new in our skies!$"

VioletCity_Gym_Text_Defeat::
